[img]gfx/ui/events/event_119.png[/img]{%randombrother% shakes his head.%SPEECH_ON%May the old gods have mercy upon us for allowing such a sight.%SPEECH_OFF%The goblin city is sequestered between opposing mountains. Saying the goblins built their city around the mountains is like saying a soldier sheathed his sword in his enemy's chest. The gibbering greenskins didn't add to the terrain, they desecrated the place whole, putting mines where trees used to be, constructing a maze of rusted shanties and lean-tos, raising cultish totems and digging primitive sacrificial pits, piling unused timber as though the mutilation of the mountain was not truly finished without blatant waste.

 But beyond the goblin rubbish does stand a central core of the city, a number of towers unambiguously set apart from the riffraff. These are clearly ancient requisitions, the stonework being unlike anything you've ever seen and surely beyond the greenskin's scope of construct. The goblins walking amongst the walls are upright and boastful as though invigorated by being allowed to stride such hallowed grounds. Nestled inside the fortress seem to be of some sort of higher nobility, well dressed goblins with servants mucking about, which means the same thing it does when it comes to humans: there's good loot to be had.

 A rare sight are the little ones running about. Families, if that's what the greenskins truly have, will mean that a fight here will be a vicious one. The little maggots will have more to protect than just their savageness and greed, and that which must extend itself beyond its own vices is also that which has been weakened.}

changes.before:
[img]gfx/ui/events/event_119.png[/img]{%randombrother%摇了摇头。%SPEECH_ON%但愿旧神怜悯，别让我们再看见这样的景象。%SPEECH_OFF%地精城隐在两山之间。说地精依山建城，就像说士兵把剑收进了敌人的胸膛。那些吱哇乱叫的绿皮并未为山川添彩，而是将此地彻底糟蹋了：原本长树的地方开成矿坑，锈迹斑斑的棚屋与简陋窝棚连成迷宫，邪教般的图腾高高竖起，原始的献祭坑遍布地面。没用过的木料堆得到处都是，仿佛不如此公然浪费，对山体的蹂躏便不算完成。

然而，越过这些地精的垃圾，城中还矗立着一片核心建筑。几座高塔与周遭破烂泾渭分明，显然是它们侵占的远古遗产。那石工技艺你前所未见，绝非绿皮所能造出。城墙之间行走的地精昂首挺胸，趾高气扬，仿佛获准踏入如此神圣的地方，就令它们精神大振。堡垒内住的似乎是更高等的贵族：衣着华丽的地精身旁，仆从忙个不停。这和在人类社会中意味着同一件事——里面有好东西可抢。

难得一见的是，还有些小地精跑来跑去。如果绿皮真有所谓家庭，那此地一旦开战，必然格外凶狠。这些小蛆虫要保护的，将不再只有野蛮与贪欲。而当一个生灵不得不顾及自身恶念以外的东西时，也就有了弱点。}

